sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Gateway
  participant F as x402 facilitator
  participant P as pocket-ap
  participant R as RelayMiner
  participant T as tool-router
  A->>G: POST /v1/run/coingecko/price
  G-->>A: 402 + PAYMENT-REQUIRED ($0.001 USDC)
  A->>G: same request + PAYMENT-SIGNATURE
  G->>F: verify the signed authorization
  G->>P: forward the run
  P->>R: signed Pocket relay
  R->>T: run the tool (under 9 s)
  T-->>G: envelope: data, sources, price
  G->>F: settle, only if the run succeeded
  F-->>G: Base Sepolia tx
  G-->>A: 200 + PAYMENT-RESPONSE + X-Akashi-Via: pocket
  Note over R,T: later: claim, proof and settlement on Pocket
